{
  "id": "explore-dashboard-rows-lj-preview",
  "title": "Read rows on a dashboard (preview)",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Explore the rows on a Grafana Play dashboard to see which panels each row groups together and what happens to its heading when its contents are hidden."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Explore the rows on Time series graphs to see which panels each row groups together and how a row's heading stays visible when its contents are hidden."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "rows",
      "title": "Rows on Time series graphs",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/d/000000016/time-series-graphs?from=now-1h&to=now&timezone=browser",
          "content": "Open the **Time series graphs** dashboard."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid dashboard-row-title-Interpolation modes']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000016",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "Focus on the **Interpolation modes** row heading.",
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "This row groups the panels **Interpolation mode: smooth**, **Interpolation mode: Step before**, and **Interpolation mode: Step after**."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid dashboard-row-title-Interpolation modes']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000016",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "Select the **Interpolation modes** heading to collapse the row."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "The row's panels are hidden. The heading stays visible so you can expand the row again."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid dashboard-row-title-Interpolation modes']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000016",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "Select the **Interpolation modes** heading again to expand the row."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid dashboard-row-title-Soft min & max']",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/d/000000016",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "content": "Find the **Soft min & max** row heading.",
          "doIt": false,
          "lazyRender": true
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "This row groups four panels about minimum and maximum values."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
